# Build artifacts and local scratch files, anchored to the repository root.
#
# The leading slashes matter: an unanchored pattern matches at every depth, so
# a bare `config` here would silently exclude internal/config — which is
# exactly what it did once, with `git status` reporting nothing amiss.
/aws-s3-reverse-proxy
/aws-s3-reverse-proxy.tar
/config
/test.txt
